  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0f13" />
    <meta name="description" content="Public CAD assemblies and FunCAD design packages in one rigid-body simulator, under the same gravity and push tests." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://thegenlab.ai/funcad/demo/" />
    <link rel="icon" href="../favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <title>Datasets in physics · FunCAD demo</title>
    <script is:inline>
      (function () {
        var t = "";
        try { t = localStorage.getItem("funcad-theme") || ""; } catch (e) {}
        if (t === "dark" || t === "light") document.documentElement.dataset.theme = t;
        document.documentElement.classList.add("js");
      })();
    </script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../styles.css?v=20261011-4" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="demo.css?v=20261011-3" />
  </head>
  <body class="demo-page">
    <svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true">
      <symbol id="i-cube" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5v-9z" /><path d="M12 12l8-4.5M12 12v9M12 12L4 7.5" /></symbol>
      <symbol id="i-theme" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8" /><path d="M12 4a8 8 0 0 1 0 16z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" /></symbol>
      <symbol id="i-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8" /></symbol>
    </svg>

    <header class="nav is-solid">
      <a class="brand" href="../" aria-label="FunCAD project page"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>FunCAD</a>
      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Demo">
        <a class="nav-optional" href="../">Project page</a>
        <a href="./" aria-current="page">Datasets in physics</a>
        <a href="animation/">Animation vs. physics</a>
      </nav>
      <button class="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Toggle dark mode" aria-pressed="false"><svg><use href="#i-theme" /></svg></button>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="demo-hero">
        <div class="wrap">
          <span class="kicker">Comparison demo</span>
          <h1>Do public CAD assemblies <em>actually work?</em></h1>
          <p class="sub">One rigid-body simulator, the same two tests for every assembly: stand still under gravity for 4 s, then take a small push on the first joint.</p>
          <nav class="tabs" aria-label="Demo pages">
            <a class="tab" href="./" aria-current="page">Datasets in physics</a>
            <a class="tab" href="animation/">Animation vs. physics</a>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="demo-section" aria-label="Results by source">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="score">
            <p class="score-legend"><span class="fall">Falls apart</span><span class="jam">Stands, won't move</span><span class="works">Works</span></p>
            <div class="score-row"><span class="score-name">Fusion 360 Gallery<small>8 assemblies</small></span><span class="score-bar"><span class="fall" style="--n: 4">4</span><span class="jam" style="--n: 4">4</span></span></div>
            <div class="score-row"><span class="score-name">AutoMate<small>8 assemblies</small></span><span class="score-bar"><span class="fall" style="--n: 1">1</span><span class="jam" style="--n: 7">7</span></span></div>
            <div class="score-row"><span class="score-name">Articraft<small>8 assemblies</small></span><span class="score-bar"><span class="fall" style="--n: 3">3</span><span class="jam" style="--n: 4">4</span><span class="works" style="--n: 1">1</span></span></div>
            <div class="score-row ours"><span class="score-name">FunCAD packages<small>3 designs</small></span><span class="score-bar"><span class="works" style="--n: 3">3</span></span></div>
          </div>
          <p class="demo-note">Public assemblies were sampled from mechanism types that our tasks also cover, such as gear trains, hinges, sliders and linkages.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="demo-section tint" aria-labelledby="fall">
        <div class="wrap">
          <header class="demo-head"><h2 id="fall">Can't even stand</h2><p><b>8 of 24</b> public assemblies fall apart under gravity alone.</p></header>
          <div class="cards three">
            <article class="demo-card">
              <div class="card-media"><figure class="clip"><video data-src="media/grippers.mp4" data-poster="media/grippers.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-label="Two hinged grippers falling as one, since no part is anchored"></video><span class="clip-label bad">Falls</span></figure></div>
              <div class="card-body">
                <h3>Nothing is fixed down</h3>
                <p>No part is anchored to the ground, so the whole assembly drops.</p>
                <div class="card-meta"><span>AutoMate · slowed 11×</span><a class="open-3d" href="case/?id=grippers"><svg><use href="#i-cube" /></svg>Open in 3D</a></div>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="demo-card">
              <div class="card-media"><figure class="clip"><video data-src="media/pump.mp4" data-poster="media/pump.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-label="Washers and a bushing dropping out of a piston pump; the housing is drawn see-through"></video><span class="clip-label bad">Parts drop out</span></figure></div>
              <div class="card-body">
                <h3>Parts with no joint</h3>
                <p>Washers and a bushing sit in place but belong to no joint, so they drop out of the pump.</p>
                <div class="card-meta"><span>Fusion 360 Gallery · slowed 3×</span><a class="open-3d" href="case/?id=pump"><svg><use href="#i-cube" /></svg>Open in 3D</a></div>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="demo-card">
              <div class="card-media"><figure class="clip"><video data-src="media/arm.mp4" data-poster="media/arm.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-label="A robotic arm folding down under its own weight"></video><span class="clip-label bad">Sags</span></figure></div>
              <div class="card-body">
                <h3>Joints that hold nothing</h3>
                <p>Its joints turn freely and nothing holds them, so the arm folds under its own weight.</p>
                <div class="card-meta"><span>Articraft</span><a class="open-3d" href="case/?id=arm"><svg><use href="#i-cube" /></svg>Open in 3D</a></div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="demo-section" aria-labelledby="jam">
        <div class="wrap">
          <header class="demo-head"><h2 id="jam">Stands, but won't move</h2><p><b>15 of 24</b> hold still, then don't move under the test push.</p></header>
          <div class="cards two">
            <article class="demo-card">
              <div class="card-media split" data-sync>
                <figure class="clip"><video data-src="media/door-push.mp4" data-poster="media/door-push.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-label="A door pushed about its hinge does not move"></video><span class="clip-label bad">Test push</span></figure>
                <figure class="clip"><video data-src="media/door-free.mp4" data-poster="media/door-free.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-label="The same push with door-frame contact removed swings the door open"></video><span class="clip-label good">Contact removed</span></figure>
              </div>
              <div class="card-body">
                <h3>Touching faces lock the joint</h3>
                <p>The hinge is right, but door and frame touch with zero clearance. Contact holds it shut; even a 10× push barely moves it.</p>
                <div class="card-meta"><span>Fusion 360 Gallery</span><a class="open-3d" href="case/?id=door"><svg><use href="#i-cube" /></svg>Open in 3D</a></div>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="demo-card">
              <div class="card-media split" data-sync>
                <figure class="clip"><video data-src="media/ring-push.mp4" data-poster="media/ring-push.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-label="A ring gear with three gears does not turn under the test push"></video><span class="clip-label bad">Test push</span></figure>
                <figure class="clip"><video data-src="media/ring-x10.mp4" data-poster="media/ring-x10.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-label="At ten times the push the gear train turns"></video><span class="clip-label good">10× push</span></figure>
              </div>
              <div class="card-body">
                <h3>Only a much bigger push turns it</h3>
                <p>The gears mesh with zero backlash. The ring gear ignores the test push and turns only at ten times the load.</p>
                <div class="card-meta"><span>AutoMate</span><a class="open-3d" href="case/?id=ringgear"><svg><use href="#i-cube" /></svg>Open in 3D</a></div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="demo-section tint" aria-labelledby="ours">
        <div class="wrap">
          <header class="demo-head"><h2 id="ours">Ours: built to be tested</h2><p>Same simulator, same push: <b>3 of 3</b> stand, then turn their first joint.</p></header>
          <div class="cards two">
            <article class="demo-card">
              <div class="card-media"><figure class="clip"><video data-src="media/clock.mp4" data-poster="media/clock.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-label="Our alarm clock: the push turns the gear train and the hands move"></video><span class="clip-label good">Moves</span></figure></div>
              <div class="card-body">
                <h3>Mechanical alarm clock</h3>
                <p>The push on the barrel turns the gear train, and the hands move.</p>
                <div class="card-meta"><span>FunCAD package</span><a class="open-3d" href="case/?id=clock"><svg><use href="#i-cube" /></svg>Open in 3D</a></div>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="demo-card">
              <div class="card-media"><figure class="clip"><video data-src="media/wiper.mp4" data-poster="media/wiper.jpg" muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-label="Our four-bar wiper: the crank drives the arm through its sweep"></video><span class="clip-label good">Moves</span></figure></div>
              <div class="card-body">
                <h3>Four-bar windshield wiper</h3>
                <p>The crank drives the coupler, and the arm sweeps.</p>
                <div class="card-meta"><span>FunCAD package</span><a class="open-3d" href="case/?id=wiper"><svg><use href="#i-cube" /></svg>Open in 3D</a></div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
          <p class="demo-note">Rigid-body simulation in PyChrono with identical settings for every assembly. Gravity test: fails if any part moves more than 10 mm in 4 s. Push test: a load scaled to the driven part's weight on the first movable joint; passes at 10° or 10 mm of travel. Files are only translated: no joints, anchors or limits are added. Gear and rack meshing is not modelled, so our third design, a rack-and-pinion gate, passes on its pinion alone.</p>
          <div class="demo-next"><a class="pill on-page pill-solid" href="animation/">Animation vs. physics<svg><use href="#i-arrow" /></svg></a></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="wrap">
        <a class="brand" href="../"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>FunCAD</a>
        <span>Can It Actually Work? Synthesizing Functional CAD Mechanisms · 2026</span>
      </div>
    </footer>

    <script is:inline type="module" src="demo.js?v=20261011-3"></script>
  </body>
</html>
